2. What you may not do

   a. Commercial use. You may not use the software, or anything made from it,
      to earn money or any other commercial advantage: you may not sell it,
      charge for access to it, offer it as a paid service, bundle it with a
      paid product or service, or use it in a business's products.

   b. Distribution. You may not copy, publish, share, upload or otherwise
      distribute the software, a changed version of it, or a substantial part
      of its code, in source or built form, except to send a change back to
      this repository. To point others to the software, link to the official
      repository or site.

   c. Name and look. You may not use the name "Lydia", her character or the
      software's look to identify, promote or present anything other than the
      official software.

3. Contributions

   If you send a change to this repository (a pull request, a patch or code in
